 "intro": "Near Ibera on the Ebro, across from Dertosa (Tortosa), Spain, 215 BC. Carthage has ordered Hasdrubal Barca to march to Italy and join Hannibal. You are the brothers Gnaeus and Publius Cornelius Scipio, with the Roman armies in Spain.",
